			<div id="prefooter" class="footer__pre">
		<div class="blocks-container">
			
<p>Investment products and services are offered through BNP Paribas Securities Corporation, a wholly owned subsidiary of BNP Paribas, S.A., registered broker-dealer and futures commission merchant, and member of FINRA, SIPC, and NFA. Custody and certain other services are provided by the New York branch of BNP Paribas, S.A. Deposits are not FDIC insured.</p>
		</div>
